<title>SINGAPORE: Hind Hotels first-half net up 47.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Hind Hotels first-half net up 47.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>	    (in million S$ unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				 2.67  vs     1.81</p>
<p>    Group shares (cents)		   4.05  vs     2.75</p>
<p>    Turnover				  19.59  vs    17.19</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			   3.20  vs     2.20</p>
<p>    Tax					  0.53  vs     0.39</p>
<p>Note - Hind Hotels International said performance in second half of the year is expected to improve and the company did not declare a dividend.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
